rdinated attack  against him he finds himself in serious  danger but he is saved at the last  moment by Koji Koda who uses his Quirk  to command bunch of birds to carry  present Mike out of Harm's Way the  heroes and cops are doing their best to  hold off the huge mass of people trying  to break into the hospital but they are  greatly outnumbered and they are clearly  struggling even though most of these  villains are just civilians who don't  have fighting experience what's making  it harder to fight them is their  fanatical Devotion to spinner and his  cause now assuming that they are not  being controlled by some sort of Quirk  the reason why they are so fanatically  committed to spinner is because they  truly believe that he is the only one  representing them and fighting for them  against a society that has mistreated  them for Generations the people with  mutant type quirks have gone through  struggles that individuals who look  human simply cannot understand as we all  know in this world 20 of the population  is quirkless so they just look  completely human out of the 80 who have  quirks the majority have emitter and  transformation type quirks that either  maintain their human appearance and just  give them cool powers or that may alter  their appearance through transformation  but only temporarily and so the minority  of people who have mutant type quirks  and whose appearance is permanently  different from that of the average human  have faced a ton of discrimination and  even outright pogroms and massacres one  of the villain leaders from the  Paranormal Liberation Front jumps up on  a platform and tells all the mutant  Quirk users to let their rage consume  them and to hit back against this cruel  and unjust Society we then get a quick  history lesson in which we learned that  ever since quirks first appeared the  individuals with mutant type quirks that  made them look different from everyone  else were targeted for persecution not  only were they discriminated against but  they were even outright attacked and  killed and sometimes large numbers of  innocent people were massacred all at  once when the people doing these  terrible things were asked why they did  them they would just say things like  they were gross these attackers simply  did not see mutant type Quirk users as  real human beings and just because they  looked different they attacked them now  in the modern world the hero Society  wants people to believe that equality  has been achieved and that there are  people with mutant type quirks in  position of power and influence so for  example we have high ranking members of  the police force who may look like a dog  or a cat we have nezu as the principal  of UA and so on although I'm not even  sure why nezu was included here because  he's not really a human with a mutant  type Quirk he's actually an animal with  a high intelligence Quirk anyway  according to this villain leader while  the situation for those with mutant type  quirks may seem better now in big cities  where people are used to being around a  ton of diversity as soon as you get out  of the cities and into the country the  same prejudices against the mutant type  Quirk users still exist and all the  innocent people there are still facing  horrible discrimination all these Heroes  with mutant type quirks like Coda and  Shoji are just City Slickers who have no  idea what kind of hardships they would  have faced if they were in the  countryside to the villains these heroes  are traitors to their own kind and for  the villains there is no more room for  negotiation or concessions it is now  time for the oppressed to join spinner  and fight back against this society and  its lies spinner is their hero he will  lead them to True freedom  meanwhile spinner has no idea what these  guys are even talking about ever since  all for one gave him that  gigantification Quirk his mind has been  going blank and he hasn't really been  himself the only clear t